          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Al completar el cuestionario inicial de WhatsApp, el equipo de coordinación te presentará opciones de agenda ajustadas a tu huso horario local en {pais}.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="card-matte p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 group cursor-pointer transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center text-base sm:text-lg font-bold font-sans text-white list-none">
            <span>¿La biodescodificación sustituye a mi médico de cabecera en {cityName}?</span>
            <span class="text-[#779DD1] text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 font-sans font-bold">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            No. Alma Holística promueve una visión integrativa de la salud. La terapia complementa la atención médica abordando la raíz emocional inconsciente del síntoma. Nunca sugerimos suspender tratamientos ni prescripciones facultativas.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================================================= -->
  <!-- BANNER FINAL DE CONVERSIÓN                                                -->
  <!-- ========================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[#060A1A] py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="card-matte p-8 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 text-center relative overflow-hidden max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-wider text-[#779DD1] uppercase mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>AGENDA ABIERTA EN {cityName.toUpperCase()}</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">
          Da el Primer Paso Hacia el Origen de tu Síntoma
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 font-sans mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Haz el test de evaluación rápida de 4 pasos para recibir una primera lectura terapéutica y coordinar tu sesión online por WhatsApp.
        </p>

        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <a
            href={fallbackWhatsAppUrl}
            data-open-quiz="true"
            data-city={rawSlug}
            data-city-name={cityName}
            class="btn-whatsapp-primary inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-sans font-bold shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#25D366]"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true">
              <path fill="currentColor" d="M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7 82.8-184.5 184.6-184.5 49.3 0 95.6 19.2 130.4 54.1 34.8 34.9 56.2 81.2 56.1 130.5 0 101.8-84.9 184.6-186.6 184.6zm101.2-138.2c-5.5-2.8-32.8-16.2-37.9-18-5.1-1.9-8.8-2.8-12.5 2.8-3.7 5.6-14.3 18-17.6 21.8-3.2 3.7-6.5 4.2-12 1.4-32.6-16.3-54-29.1-75.5-66-5.7-9.8 5.7-9.1 16.3-30.3 1.8-3.7.9-6.9-.5-9.7-1.4-2.8-12.5-30.1-17.1-41.2-4.5-10.8-9.1-9.3-12.5-9.5-3.2-.2-6.9-.2-10.6-.2-3.7 0-9.7 1.4-14.8 6.9-5.1 5.6-19.4 19-19.4 46.3 0 27.3 19.9 53.7 22.6 57.4 2.8 3.7 39.1 59.7 94.8 83.8 35.2 15.2 49 16.5 66.6 13.9 10.7-1.6 32.8-13.4 37.4-26.4 4.6-13 4.6-24.1 3.2-26.4-1.3-2.5-5-3.9-10.5-6.6z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Agendar Sesión en {cityName}</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
)}
